WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.269
-"F9" -- gosh,
we're so excited about this.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.937
And I can't think of
a better movie

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:08.141
to bring back theaters, safely.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.911
If it's safe -- it is -- go to a
movie theater and watch "F9."

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.980
It is loud. It is fast.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.348
Well, it's furious.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:19.686
It is loud, but it is an
action-packed movie.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.120
It's got a great story.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.389
Now, this is -- You've taken it
to another level.

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:27.293
Did you even think
you'd end up going this far?

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:31.898
-You know,
if you would have told me

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.133
we would be here
20 years from now...

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.500
-Yeah.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.636
-...20 years ago, I would have
thought you were crazy.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:39.305
-Yeah. But now you're -- I mean,

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.574
let me just put this
in perspective for you.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:45.544
Actually, in this movie,
we talk about your family.

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:46.946
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:51.217
-But in real life, your son is
in the movie, playing you.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.053
-Oh!

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.422
-That couldn't have happened.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:59.726
That's amazing.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.861
But that couldn't have happened.
That's great.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.062
How was that?
-Can you believe that?

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:05.965
Alright, so, first of all,
it wasn't my idea.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.901
I can't take the credit.
It was Justin Lin, the director.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.302
-The director, yeah.

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:13.339
-But we've been making these
movies for so long

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:17.210
that every time one of
my children were born,

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.813
I was usually working on
a "Fast and Furious" movie.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.317
So, the director and the cast
all have their own relationship

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.018
with my children.

00:01:26.018 --> 00:01:31.791
And it was his idea
for my son to play Young Dom.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:36.262
And the irony is,
the thing I remember the most

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:40.433
was coming home that day,
because when you see the movie,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.936
it's kind of a deep scene,
so Dom is in

00:01:43.936 --> 00:01:46.672
a deep state of mind.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:50.676
And my son was watching me
work the whole day,

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:55.448
and it wasn't till I got home,
when I saw a twinkle in his eye

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:59.351
because he had finally
seen his father come home,

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:02.555
as opposed to being with
Dom Toretto the whole day.

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:03.990
It was so adorable.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:07.126
It was so beautiful.
-Wow! It's a big deal.

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:09.996
That's what makes -- I mean,
obviously, fans of the movie --

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.831
we kind of grew -- Everyone grew
with you and these characters.

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:14.434
-And I grew with you!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.204
-No. Sit down!
You have to sit down!

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.972
Vin, you can't go in the
audience! Come on!

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:22.975
-I grew with you!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.877
I'm here for you!

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:26.346
We make the movie for you!

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:27.713
-Let's go do -- Here, we can

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.915
throw the clip
from on the stairs.

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:31.483
-Let's do the clip.
-Come here, come on, come on.

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:32.552
-Come on. Let's do it.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.886
-Let's go throw the clip
from over here.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:34.888
Yeah!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.622
-Yeah!

00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:41.260
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:45.164
-I want to show -- I want to
show everyone a clip.

00:02:45.164 --> 00:02:50.069
Here is Vin Diesel in "F9."
Take a look at this.

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:54.140
-Where's the bridge?

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.546
No. No, no.

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:00.813
Dom...

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:35.848
Well, that was new.

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:38.217
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.353
-Vin Diesel, everybody!

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.021
That's how you do it
right there.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.923
"F9" hits theaters this Friday.

